<h2 class="bold" id="js-module-reference"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="autocomplete#js-module-reference">JS module reference</a></h2>
<p>Autocomplete is backed with <a href="https://alphagov.github.io/accessible-autocomplete" class="underline">accessible-autocomplete | see docs</a></p>
<p>All elements with <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">data-autocomplete</span></span></code></span> attribute will be initialised automatically.</p>
<p>Config can be also passed via <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">data-autocomplete-config</span></span></code></span> as a JSON string. Please note that, due to security issues, it is not possible to pass any executable code via this attribute. If you need to configure a filtering function, please initialize Autocomplete manually.</p>
